 skills, such as memory and concentration, and can be a fun and enjoyable way to challenge oneself. The puzzle's unique twist and challenging rules make it a standout among other puzzles and games.\n\n\n \n\nThe Observer Digital Edition is a great resource for fans of the Sudoku puzzle, as it provides access to a wide range of puzzles and games. The edition is available for purchase, and provides a convenient and easy way to access the latest puzzles and content. The fact that the completed puzzle is available in the next week's edition provides an added incentive to purchase, as players can check their work and see the solution. The Observer Digital Edition is a great way to stay up-to-date with the latest news and content, and is a valuable resource for fans of the Sudoku puzzle. The edition's wide range of features and content make it a must-have for anyone who enjoys puzzles and games.\n\n\n \n\nThe Sudoku puzzle is a fun and challenging way to pass the time, and is a great way to improve cognitive skills and reasoning abilities. The puzzle's unique twist and rules make it a standout among other puzzles and games, and its wide range of fans and enthusiasts is a testament to its enduring appeal. The fact that the puzzle is available in a variety of formats, including online and in print, makes it accessible to a wide range of players. The puzzle's ability to challenge and engage players, while also providing a sense of accomplishment and satisfaction, makes it a truly unique and enjoyable experience. The Sudoku puzzle is a great way to challenge oneself and have fun, and is a valuable addition to any puzzle or game collection.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.4018803536891937}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305700585246086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0232519693672657}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.008725020103156567}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"